Z||000000||danny boy||12-24-2001||12:36 AM|||| I started a new job. Thats the good part. Now, My landlord died, his son offered the house we're renting to us for 105K, we had it appraised for 72K, he said no way, get out. In one day My truck caught on fire, put me 3 hrs behind on my day, got back home, and the gates to the yard were locked. I went down the road to turn around at the place I quit for the new job with no notice and being as tired as I was after having a 15 hr day at work misjudged and completely tore town an awning over their fuel loading rack.Tore up my trailer pretty bad,too. Didn't get fired, but still bad.<BR> Went looking for houses with a realtor and his van broke down in the rain. Went out to my property to relieve some stress and shot my gun. on the way back got caught in a real bad wind/rain storm and my Stealth got hit by a tree branch that fell. Got another call from landlord's son- he sold the house and we have till Jan 1 to get out. our new house won't be ready till may, but we found a short term rental, so we're OK, but Christmas and Newyears is cancelled. I now have one week to get My Fiero back together and my garage empty.Before this my uncle was killed at work 9/4, then the 9/11 incident. My dad is in the hospital with a bloodpressure of 300 over 120, and my brother just turned 21 and is a paranoid schitzophrenic/ alcoholic. <P>Stress?  Yeah, a little.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PFF_sig_5.jpg"> ||||reg||1
